---
import { hackspainSponsors } from "@/lib/hackspain-sponsors";
---
<section class="portfolio-bio" aria-label="About me">
      <p>
        Hi, I&apos;m Samuel, a <span role="img" aria-label="Spanish">🇪🇸</span>{" "}
        <strong>16-year-old</strong> full stack developer from Spain. I&apos;ve been building things{" "}
        <strong>since I was 9</strong>, starting with Roblox games and finding my way into web
        development, AI, and products that make people&apos;s lives a little easier.
      </p>
      <p>
        I&apos;m currently a <strong>product engineer</strong> at{" "}
        <a href="https://quiver.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <img src="/svg/quiver.svg" alt="" width={18} height={18} class="quiver-icon" />{" "}
          QuiverAI
        </a>, working on AI-native tools for generating, editing, and animating
        vector graphics. I&apos;ve helped build the <strong>Agent UI, Icons UI, and Fonts UI</strong>,
        and worked incredibly hard to refine the product and get every detail right.
      </p>
      <p>
        I&apos;m also a co-founder of{" "}
        <a href="https://hackspain.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HackSpain</a>,
        a <strong>36-hour hackathon for 250 young builders</strong> in Madrid,
        backed by{" "}
        {hackspainSponsors.map((sponsor, index) => (
          <Fragment>
            <span class="sponsor-mention">
            {index === hackspainSponsors.length - 1 && "and "}
            <a href={`https://${sponsor.domain}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sponsor-link" aria-label={sponsor.name}>
              <span class={`sponsor-tile sponsor-tile-${sponsor.logo}`} aria-hidden="true">
                {sponsor.color ? (
                  <img src={`/svg/sponsors/${sponsor.logo}.svg`} alt="" width={18} height={18} class="sponsor-icon" />
                ) : (
                  <span
                    class="sponsor-icon sponsor-mask"
                    style={`mask-image: url(/svg/sponsors/${sponsor.logo}.svg)`}
                  />
                )}
              </span>
              <span class="sponsor-name">{sponsor.name}</span>
            </a>
            {index < hackspainSponsors.length - 1 ? <span class="sponsor-comma">,</span> : ","}
            </span>
            {index < hackspainSponsors.length - 1 && " "}
          </Fragment>
        ))}
        {" "}among others.
      </p>
      <p>
        Alongside that, I&apos;ve built and launched <strong>stealth apps</strong> through
        my own app studio, generating <strong>five figures in revenue</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        What keeps me going is pretty simple: watching someone use something
        I&apos;ve made and hearing that it helped. I want to build a company that
        makes a lasting, positive impact, give back to my family, and head to the
        US for college. In the meantime, I&apos;m <strong>learning by building</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Away from the keyboard, I&apos;ve been <strong>practising karate for 8 years</strong> and
        hold a blue-brown belt. I also play football and enjoy talking through
        world issues and geopolitics with friends. There&apos;s always another
        perspective to learn from.
      </p>
    </section>
